
@startuml 05_creational
title Порождающие паттерны TaskFlow: Singleton, Factory Method, Abstract Factory

hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

' ===== Паттерн 1: Singleton =====
package "Singleton" {
  class AppSettings <<Singleton>> {
    - pathToFile : string
    - format : string
    - AppSettings()
    + instance() : AppSettings&
    + getPathToFile() : string
    + getFormat() : string
    + setPathToFile(p : string) : void
    + setFormat(f : string) : void
  }
  class TaskFactory <<Singleton>> {
    - creators : vector<unique_ptr<TaskCreator>>
    - TaskFactory()
    + instance() : TaskFactory&
    + create(type : string) : unique_ptr<Task>
    + typeNames() : vector<string>
  }
}
note bottom of AppSettings
  конструктор закрыт, копирование запрещено;
  единственная точка доступа — instance()
end note
note bottom of TaskFactory
  тот же приём Meyers' Singleton:
  static-переменная внутри instance()
end note

' ===== Паттерн 2: Factory Method =====
package "Factory Method" {
  interface TaskCreator <<Creator>> {
    + typeName() : string
    + create() : unique_ptr<Task>
  }
  class SimpleTaskCreator <<ConcreteCreator>> {
    + create() : unique_ptr<Task>
  }
  class DeadlineTaskCreator <<ConcreteCreator>> {
    + create() : unique_ptr<Task>
  }
  class RecurringTaskCreator <<ConcreteCreator>> {
    + create() : unique_ptr<Task>
  }
  class Task <<Product>> {
    + typeName() : string
    + extraInfo() : string
  }
  class SimpleTask <<ConcreteProduct>>
  class DeadlineTask <<ConcreteProduct>>
  class RecurringTask <<ConcreteProduct>> {
    - intervalDays : int
    + setInterval(n : int) : void
  }
}
Task <|-- SimpleTask
Task <|-- DeadlineTask
Task <|-- RecurringTask
TaskCreator <|.. SimpleTaskCreator
TaskCreator <|.. DeadlineTaskCreator
TaskCreator <|.. RecurringTaskCreator
TaskCreator ..> Task : создаёт
SimpleTaskCreator ..> SimpleTask : создаёт
DeadlineTaskCreator ..> DeadlineTask : создаёт
RecurringTaskCreator ..> RecurringTask : создаёт
TaskFactory o-- TaskCreator : реестр создателей
TaskFactory ..> Task : создаёт по имени типа

' ===== Паттерн 3: Abstract Factory =====
package "Abstract Factory" {
  interface IStorageFactory <<AbstractFactory>> {
    + formatName() : string
    + createTaskStorage() : unique_ptr<ITaskStorage>
    + createSettingsStorage() : unique_ptr<ISettingsStorage>
  }
  class TxtStorageFactory <<ConcreteFactory>> {
    + formatName() : string
    + createTaskStorage() : unique_ptr<ITaskStorage>
    + createSettingsStorage() : unique_ptr<ISettingsStorage>
  }
  class CsvStorageFactory <<ConcreteFactory>> {
    + formatName() : string
    + createTaskStorage() : unique_ptr<ITaskStorage>
    + createSettingsStorage() : unique_ptr<ISettingsStorage>
  }
  interface ITaskStorage <<AbstractProduct>> {
    + save(list : TaskList, path : string) : bool
    + load(list : TaskList, path : string) : int
  }
  interface ISettingsStorage <<AbstractProduct>> {
    + save(path : string, format : string) : bool
    + load(path : string&, format : string&) : bool
  }
  class TxtTaskStorage <<ConcreteProduct>>
  class CsvTaskStorage <<ConcreteProduct>>
  class TxtSettingsStorage <<ConcreteProduct>>
  class CsvSettingsStorage <<ConcreteProduct>>
}
IStorageFactory <|.. TxtStorageFactory
IStorageFactory <|.. CsvStorageFactory
ITaskStorage <|.. TxtTaskStorage
ITaskStorage <|.. CsvTaskStorage
ISettingsStorage <|.. TxtSettingsStorage
ISettingsStorage <|.. CsvSettingsStorage
IStorageFactory ..> ITaskStorage : создаёт
IStorageFactory ..> ISettingsStorage : создаёт
TxtStorageFactory ..> TxtTaskStorage : создаёт
TxtStorageFactory ..> TxtSettingsStorage : создаёт
CsvStorageFactory ..> CsvTaskStorage : создаёт
CsvStorageFactory ..> CsvSettingsStorage : создаёт
AppSettings --> IStorageFactory : хранит выбранное семейство
@enduml
